OL,3,ABulgaria summons Russian ambassador
OL,4,Aafter ship sinks in Black Sea drone
OL,5,Aattack
OL,6,
OL,7,FBulgarian Prime Minister Rumen Radev
OL,8,Fhas summoned the Russian ambassador
OL,9,Fafter two merchant ships were struck in
OL,10,Fa drone attack off Bulgaria's Black Sea
OL,11,Fcoast.
OL,13,FEleven crew members are missing and one
OL,14,Fsailor was saved, according to local
OL,15,Fofficials, after one of the vessels
OL,16,Fsank 17 nautical miles (31km) east of
OL,17,Fthe village of Krapets.
OL,19,FThe other vessel, Ukrainian owned, was
OL,20,Fhit by drones 18 nautical miles from
OL,21,Fthe town of Byala and all 15 crew were
OL,22,Frescued.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
