OL,3,ABulgaria summons Russian ambassador
OL,4,Aafter ship sinks in Black Sea drone
OL,5,Aattack
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe attacks come a week after two other
OL,8,Fcommercial ships were hit by sea and
OL,9,Faerial drones in Bulgaria's exclusive
OL,10,Feconomic zone. One of the ships, the
OL,11,FAlfa Watan, sank and all 10 crew,
OL,12,Fincluding nine Syrians, are presumed
OL,13,Fdead.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
